    "description": "Come see this rare, exquisitely-designed view residence, on a quiet residential tree-lined alley near buzzy Hayes Valley & Alamo Square. Skillfully re-imagined with exceptional attention to detail! Currently configured as two vacant legally-permitted 1BR flats. Detached on 3 sides with excellent light & downtown views. High ceilings & skylights. Both flats feature new electrical systems & recessed lighting. Plumbing updates throughout including new piping, 6 heaters, 2 on-demand hot water systems & radiant bathroom floors. Luxurious finishes include Fireclay artisanal tile in lower kitchen & bath, Italian hand-crafted tile in upper bath, brushed nickel plumbing fixtures, 2-seat soaking tub & Marvin/custom historic windows. Comfort meets efficiency w/ insulated walls, attic & basement.  Each unit has solar panels & laundry hook-ups (1 w/d installed). Welcoming outdoor space on both levels, great for relaxing & dining al fresco. New roof, drywall, paint & security lighting. Large basement offers tons of storage. A seamless blend of elegance and functionality -- a versatile home in the city's most exciting neighborhood."
  },
